{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Nixync Fleet Server",
    "description": "\nControl center API for managing a fleet of NixOS machines.\n\nTwo kinds of client talk to this server:\n\n* **Admin clients** (the Nixync desktop UI) use the REST endpoints documented below.\n* **Machine agents** keep one persistent WebSocket open for their whole lifetime.\n\n## Agent WebSocket protocol\n\nEndpoint: `ws://<server>/ws/machines/{machine_id}` \u2014 not listed below because OpenAPI has\nno WebSocket representation. An unregistered `machine_id` is closed with code **4404**;\nregister the machine over REST first. Every frame is a JSON object with a `type` field.\n\n**Agent to server**\n\n| `type` | Fields | Sent when |\n|---|---|---|\n| `telemetry` | `cpu_percent`, `ram_used_mb`, `ram_total_mb`, `disk_used_gb`, `disk_total_gb` | Every 2 minutes |\n| `config_report` | `config` (a MachineConfig) | Right after connecting, and again after every `apply_result` |\n| `apply_result` | `apply_id`, `status` (`applied`/`failed`), `message` | After acting on an `apply_config` |\n\n**Server to agent**\n\n| `type` | Fields | Sent when |\n|---|---|---|\n| `apply_config` | `apply_id`, `config` (a MachineConfig) | A package change targets this machine, and again on reconnect while the change is still `pending` |\n\n`apply_config` always carries the **full desired configuration**, never a diff \u2014 the agent\nreconciles its whole state, so it cannot drift. An `apply_result` whose `apply_id` no\nlonger matches the machine's current one is a stale ack and is ignored.\n\n## Desired vs reported configuration\n\nA machine has two configurations, and they are deliberately separate:\n\n* `config` \u2014 what the admin **declared**. Only admin actions change it.\n* `reported_config` \u2014 what the machine says it **actually has**. `null` until it first\n  reports in.\n\nThe first report from a machine that has never been deployed to is also adopted as its\ndesired config, so an existing machine joins the fleet with its setup intact. After\nthat, a report only updates `reported_config`; a difference between the two means\nsomeone changed the box outside Nixync \u2014 configuration drift the fleet view can surface.\n",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/machines": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "machines"
        ],
        "summary": "List Machines",
        "operationId": "list_machines_machines_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MachineOut"
                  },
                  "type": "array",
                  "title": "Response List Machines Machines Get"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "machines"
        ],
        "summary": "Register Machine",
        "operationId": "register_machine_machines_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MachineCreate"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MachineOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/machines/packages": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "machines"
        ],
        "summary": "Change Packages",
        "description": "Apply a package change to selected machines, or to the whole fleet when no ids are given.",
        "operationId": "change_packages_machines_packages_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PackageMutationRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PackageMutationResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/machines/{machine_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "machines"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Machine",
        "operationId": "get_machine_machines__machine_id__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "machine_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Machine Id"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MachineOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "machines"
        ],
        "summary": "Remove Machine",
        "operationId": "remove_machine_machines__machine_id__delete",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "machine_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Machine Id"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/status": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "server"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Status",
        "operationId": "get_status_status_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Detail"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "HTTPValidationError"
      },
      "MachineConfig": {
        "properties": {
          "packages": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Packages",
            "default": []
          },
          "users": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Users",
            "default": []
          },
          "groups": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Groups",
            "default": []
          },
          "services": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Services",
            "default": []
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "MachineConfig"
      },
      "MachineCreate": {
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Name"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name"
        ],
        "title": "MachineCreate"
      },
      "MachineOut": {
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Id"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Name"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Created At"
          },
          "online": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "title": "Online"
          },
          "cpu_percent": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Cpu Percent"
          },
          "ram_used_mb": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Ram Used Mb"
          },
          "ram_total_mb": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Ram Total Mb"
          },
          "disk_used_gb": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Disk Used Gb"
          },
          "disk_total_gb": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Disk Total Gb"
          },
          "metrics_reported_at": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Metrics Reported At"
          },
          "config": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MachineConfig"
          },
          "reported_config": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MachineConfig"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "last_apply_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Last Apply Id"
          },
          "last_apply_status": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Last Apply Status"
          },
          "last_apply_message": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Last Apply Message"
          },
          "last_apply_at": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Last Apply At"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "name",
          "created_at",
          "online",
          "config"
        ],
        "title": "MachineOut"
      },
      "PackageMutationRequest": {
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "add",
              "remove"
            ],
            "title": "Action"
          },
          "packages": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Packages"
          },
          "machine_ids": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "type": "array"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Machine Ids"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "action",
          "packages"
        ],
        "title": "PackageMutationRequest"
      },
      "PackageMutationResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "results": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PackageMutationResultItem"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Results"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "results"
        ],
        "title": "PackageMutationResponse"
      },
      "PackageMutationResultItem": {
        "properties": {
          "machine_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Machine Id"
          },
          "delivery": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "pushed",
              "queued",
              "unchanged"
            ],
            "title": "Delivery",
            "description": "`pushed`: sent to a connected agent. `queued`: the agent is offline; it is delivered on reconnect. `unchanged`: the machine already proved this exact configuration, so no deployment was created and `apply_id` refers to that earlier one."
          },
          "apply_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Apply Id"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "machine_id",
          "delivery",
          "apply_id"
        ],
        "title": "PackageMutationResultItem"
      },
      "ValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "loc": {
            "items": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              ]
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Location"
          },
          "msg": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Message"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Error Type"
          },
          "input": {
            "title": "Input"
          },
          "ctx": {
            "type": "object",
            "title": "Context"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "loc",
          "msg",
          "type"
        ],
        "title": "ValidationError"
      }
    }
  }
}
